# Project Context

This repository is a Web3D TypeScript project based on React and Three.js / react-three-fiber.

When assisting with code generation, refactoring, debugging, or code review, prioritize:

- TypeScript type safety
- React component and Hook correctness
- react-three-fiber lifecycle correctness
- Three.js resource lifecycle management
- Web3D rendering performance
- Interaction and state consistency
- Testability and maintainability

Do not treat this as a generic frontend project.

For Web3D-related changes, always consider:

- render loop performance
- object allocation in animation frames
- geometry / material / texture disposal
- controls / event listener cleanup
- camera, renderer, and resize synchronization
- asset loading and fallback behavior